          "expr": "sum by (service, pool) (rate(hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_sum{job=\"spring-jvm\",service=~\"${service:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval])) / (sum by (service, pool) (rate(hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_count{job=\"spring-jvm\",service=~\"${service:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval])) > 0)",
